m_assets/steam/apps/3454130/extras/5d152e25e5e0ed5357832e4e24440146.poster.avif?t=1773768501\" class=\"bb_img\" width=100 height=100 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454130/extras/be86a19a57fac2b660cf8da57b4e91ec.poster.avif?t=1773768501\" width=150 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454130/extras/be86a19a57fac2b660cf8da57b4e91ec.webm?t=1773768501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454130/extras/19527800cba787d0e7a0a246390982ba.poster.avif?t=1773768501\" width=150 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454130/extras/19527800cba787d0e7a0a246390982ba.webm?t=1773768501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454130/extras/69f8c0516072358b4f4a532b28a1fe4a.poster.avif?t=1773768501\" width=150 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454130/extras/69f8c0516072358b4f4a532b28a1fe4a.webm?t=1773768501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to explore a world where superstitions come to life and change everything? Superstition: Black Cat takes place in a fantasy universe, but its roots lie in what we deeply believe \u2014 the signs, omens, and little rules we follow to avoid bad luck or attract good fortune. Here, these beliefs transform into game-changing items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udda4 Dive into Folklore:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the coolest superstitions from Brazil while facing challenging enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Unique Roguelite:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a different experience, and you can pick up items reflecting Brazilian superstitions and beliefs. Find items that can be swapped and stacked for a new experience in every journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Supernatural Artifacts:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful items, but beware! They come with curses until you can bargain with the black cat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc65 Local Co-op:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite a friend to face the unknown by your side. Together, you can defy bad luck and have loads of fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u267e\ufe0f Infinite Replayability:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With randomly generated rooms, enemies, and events, no playthrough will ever be the same. Each run brings a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454130/extras/6e809e658334895f9121243a6c53094b.poster.avif?t=1773768501\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3454130/extras/6e809e658334895f9121243a6c53094b.webm?t=1773768501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["LUDO Thinking"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://